scratch/

# Suite-run baselines and their run logs (never committed; EXECUTION ARTIFACTS of a
# test-suite run, not repo source): .dsh-run/suite-before.log (744 KB — the full-suite
# log of a "before" capture) + suite-before.done (empty end marker) + md5-before.txt
# (md5 pre-image of every file touched), plus the after-side probes (invoke-after.log,
# invoke-after-names.txt). The "before" trio exists to prove what the suite said BEFORE
# a patch; it is regenerated per run and has no meaning once the lane closes — do NOT
# commit it, and do NOT read its absence as a missing source file. (measured 09-22)
.dsh-run/

# Atomic-write staging dirs of the harness fs writer (dsh-fs-local writeFileAtomic: `.<basename>.<pid>.<uuid>.tmpdir`, created INSIDE the target's dir; transient + untracked, never committed; 09-15)
*.tmpdir/
